 end="00:11.850">And </span><span begin="00:11.850" end="00:12.000">my </span><span begin="00:12.000" end="00:12.870">scars </span><span begin="00:12.870" end="00:13.860">remind </span><span begin="00:13.860" end="00:14.460">me </span><span begin="00:14.460" end="00:14.670">that </span><span begin="00:14.670" end="00:14.790">the </span><span begin="00:14.790" end="00:15.450">past </span><span begin="00:15.450" end="00:15.840">is </span><span begin="00:15.840" end="00:16.860">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.340" end="00:22.650"><span begin="00:17.340" end="00:17.490">I </span><span begin="00:17.490" end="00:17.880">tear </span><span begin="00:17.880" end="00:18.180">my </span><span begin="00:18.180" end="00:18.630">heart </span><span begin="00:18.630" end="00:20.070">open </span><span begin="00:20.070" end="00:20.670">just </span><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:21.090">to </span><span begin="00:21.090" end="00:22.650">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.710" end="00:25.020"><span begin="00:22.710" end="00:23.280">Drunk </span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.460">and </span><span begin="00:23.460" end="00:23.550">I'm </span><span begin="00:23.550" end="00:24.000">feeling </span><span begin="00:24.000" end="00:25.020">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.170" end="00:27.810"><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:25.440">And </span><span begin="00:25.440" end="00:25.500">I </span><span begin="00:25.500" end="00:25.890">just </span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.190">wanna </span><span begin="00:26.190" end="00:26.520">be </span><span begin="00:26.520" end="00:27.810">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.050" end="00:29.820"><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.170">I'm </span><span begin="00:28.170" end="00:28.530">pissed </span><span begin="00:28.530" end="00:28.740">cause </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:28.830">you </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.130">came </span><span begin="00:29.130" end="00:29.820">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.820" end="00:32.970"><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.150">Why </span><span begin="00:30.150" end="00:30.570">don't </span><span begin="00:30.570" end="00:30.780">you </span><span begin="00:30.780" end="00:31.500">just </span><span begin="00:31.500" end="00:32.220">go </span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:32.970">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.000" end="00:35.610"><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.450">Cause </span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.510">you </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:34.080">channel </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.350">all </span><span begin="00:34.350" end="00:34.680">your </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:35.610">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.850" end="00:38.460"><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.120">And </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.180">I </span><span begin="00:36.180" end="00:36.510">can't </span><span begin="00:36.510" end="00:36.720">help </span><span begin="00:36.720" end="00:36.840">you </span><span begin="00:36.840" end="00:37.140">fix </span><span begin="00:37.140" end="00:38.460">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.700" end="00:40.830"><span begin="00:38.700" end="00:38.910">You're </span><span begin="00:38.910" end="00:39.360">making </span><span begin="00:39.360" end="00:39.780">me </span><span begin="00:39.780" end="00:40.830">insane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.890" end="00:43.020"><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.100">All </span><span begin="00:41.100" end="00:41.220">I </span><span begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.460">can </span><span begin="00:41.460" end="00:42.480">say </span><span begin="00:42.480" end="00:43.020">is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.070" end="00:48.930"><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:44.190">I </span><span begin="00:44.190" end="00:44.580">tear </span><span begin="00:44.580" end="00:44.760">my </span><span begin="00:44.760" end="00:45.330">heart </span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:46.470">open</span><span begin="00:46.470" end="00:46.560">, </span><span begin="00:46.560" end="00:46.710">I </span><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:47.190">sew </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:48.060">myself </span><span begin="00:48.060" end="00:48.930">shut</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.230" end="00:54.120"><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.470">My </span><span begin="00:49.470" end="00:50.640">weakness </span><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:51.720">is </span><span begin="00:51.720" end="00:51.990">that </span><span begin="00:51.990" end="00:52.140">I </span><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:52.680">care </span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:53.130">too </span><span begin="00:53.130" end="00:54.120">much</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.420" end="00:59.790"><span begin="00:54.420" end="00:54.630">And </span><span begin="00:54.630" end="00:54.750">our </span><span begin="00:54.750" end="00:55.620">scars </span><span begin="00:55.620" end="00:56.670">remind </span><span begin="00:56.670" end="00:57.210">us </span><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.420">that </span><span begin="00:57.420" end="00:57.510">the </span><span begin="00:57.510" end="00:58.170">past </span><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.560">is </span><span begin="00:58.560" end="00:59.790">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.060" end="01:05.040"><span begin="01:00.060" end="01:00.180">I </span><span begin="01:00.180" end="01:00.600">tear </span><span begin="01:00.600" end="01:00.900">my </span><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.380">heart </span><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:02.760">open </span><span begin="01:02.760" end="01:03.390">just </span><span begin="01:03.390" end="01:03.840">to </span><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:05.040">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.400" end="01:07.650"><span begin="01:05.400" end="01:05.520">I </span><span begin="01:05.520" end="01:05.940">tried </span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:06.090">to </span><span begin="01:06.090" end="01:06.450">help </span><span begin="01:06.450" end="01:06.690">you </span><span begin="01:06.690" end="01:07.650">once</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.040" end="01:10.500"><span begin="01:08.040" end="01:08.580">Against </span><span begin="01:08.580" end="01:08.760">my </span><span begin="01:08.760" end="01:09.150">own </span><span begin="01:09.150" end="01:10.500">advice</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.710" end="01:12.780"><span begin="01:10.710" end="01:10.830">I </span><span begin="01:10.830" end="01:11.220">saw </span><span begin="01:11.220" end="01:11.400">you </span><span begin="01:11.400" end="01:12.060">going </span><span begin="01:12.060" end="01:12.780">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.870" end="01:15.660"><span begin="01:12.870" end="01:13.260">But </span><span begin="01:13.260" end="01:13.470">you </span><span begin="01:13.470" end="01:14.070">never </span><span begin="01:14.070" end="01:15.660">realized</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.900" end="01:18.420"><span begin="01:15.900" end="01:16.170">That </span><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.260">you're </span><span begin="01:16.260" end="01:16.860">drowning </span><span begin="01:16.860" end="01:17.130">in </span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.340">the </span><span begin="01:17.340" end="01:18.420">water</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.540" end="01:21.120"><span begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.840">So </span><span begin="01:18.840" end="01:18.930">I </span><span begin="01:18.930" end="01:19.500">offered </span><span begin="01:19.500" end="01:19.770">you </span><span begin="01:19.770" end="01:20.100">my </span><span begin="01:20.100" end="01:21.120">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.150" end="01:23.790"><span begin="01:21.150" end="01:22.230">Compassion's </span><span begin="01:22.230" end="01:22.410">in </span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:22.680">my </span><span begin="01:22.680" end="01:23.790">nature</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.000" end="01:26.730"><span begin="01:24.000" end="01:24.540">Tonight </span><span begin="01:24.540" end="01:24.810">is </span><span begin="01:24.810" end="01:25.050">our </span><span begin="01:25.050" end="01:25.410">last </span><span begin="01:25.410" end="01:26.730">stand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.760" end="01:31.650"><span begin="01:26.760" end="01:26.880">I </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.300">tear </span><span begin="01:27.300" end="01:27.450">my </span><span begin="01:27.450" end="01:28.050">heart </span><span begin="01:28.050" end="01:29.220">open</span><span begin="01:29.220" end="01:29.250">, </span><span begin="01:29.250" end="01:29.430">I </span><span begin="01:29.430" end="01:29.910">sew </span><span begin="01:29.910" end="01:30.780">myself </span><span begin="01:30.780" end="01:31.650">shut</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.950" end="01:36.810"><span begin="01:31.950" end="01:32.190">My </span><span begin="01:32.190" end="01:33.330">weakness </span><span begin="01:33.330" end="01:34.440">is </span><span begin="01:34.440" end="01:34.680">that </span><span begin="01:34.680" end="01:34.860">I </span><span begin="01:34.860" end="01:35.370">care </span><span begin="01:35.370" end="01:35.880">too </span><span begin="01:35.880" end="01:36.810">much</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.140" end="01:42.540"><span begin="01:37.140" end="01:37.350">And </span><span begin="01:37.350" end="01:37.470">our </span><span begin="01:37.470" end="01:38.340">scars </span><span begin="01:38.340" end="01:39.390">remind </span><span begin="01:39.390" end="01:39.900">us </span><span begin="01:39.900" end="01:40.140">that </span><span begin="01:40.140" end="01:40.230">the </span><span begin="01:40.230" end="01:40.860">past </span><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:41.280">is </span><span begin="01:41.280" end="01:42.540">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.750" end="01:47.940"><span begin="01:42.750" end="01:42.900">I </span><span begin="01:42.900" end="01:43.320">tear </span><span begin="01:43.320" end="01:43.620">my </span><span begin="01:43.620" end="01:44.070">heart </span><span begin="01:44.070" end="01:45.480">open </span><span begin="01:45.480" end="01:46.110">just </span><span begin="01:46.110" end="01:46.560">to </span><span begin="01:46.560" end="01:47.940">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.120" end="01:50.340"><span begin="01:48.120" end="01:48.270">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.270" end="01:48.720">drunk </span><span begin="01:48.720" end="01:48.870">and </span><span begin="01:48.870" end="01:48.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.930" end="01:49.260">feeling </span><span begin="01:49.260" end="01:50.340">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.760" end="01:53.070"><span begin="01:50.760" end="01:50.910">And </span><span begin="01:50.910" end="01:50.940">I </span><span begin="01:50.940" end="01:51.330">just </span><span begin="01:51.330" end="01:51.630">wanna </span><span begin="01:51.630" end="01:51.870">be </span><span begin="01:51.870" end="01:53.070">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.400" end="01:55.200"><span begin="01:53.400" end="01:53.550">You </span><span begin="01:53.550" end="01:54.000">shouldn't </span><span begin="01:54.000" end="01:54.240">ever </span><span begin="01:54.240" end="01:54.510">come </span><span begin="01:54.510" end="01:55.200">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.230" end="01:58.470"><span begin="01:55.230" end="01:55.560">Why </span><span begin="01:55.560" end="01:56.010">don't </span><span begin="01:56.010" end="01:56.190">you </span><span begin="01:56.190" end="01:56.940">just </span><span begin="01:56.940" end="01:57.720">go </span><span begin="01:57.720" end="01:58.440">home</span><span begin="01:58.440" end="01:58.470">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.470" end="02:01.140"><span begin="01:58.470" end="01:58.860">Cause </span><span begin="01:58.860" end="01:58.950